"comments": 7, "score_up": 51, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 77, "created": 1795545954000, "id": "2125299889731227927", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2125299863646617600/img/FA1VzWGGrLPKLLDC.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125299863646617600/pl/A3UyvH5_qXVBvM5w.m3u8", "aspectRatio": [4, 5], "heightRatio": 125, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125299863646617600/vid/avc1/320x400/iLWzUoJZu4z9eZu2.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007264570377695232/YnzoeUCx_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Info Battle Maiden", "username": "info_maiden"}, "content": "They get mad when we say Heritage American.\n\nThen they take our tax money and put up a statue in Carmel, Indiana called \u2018Indian Heritage.\u2019", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1444}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATon1ZYv7", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 194, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8953905, "raw_content": "The wife and i decided this year because its the first time ive been home for Thanksgiving in four years, that we would do it up this year. We started early getting things here and there, living on a fixed income sux. We have two elderly people in our park and they live alone, one is on dialysis and the other lives alone but is the block mayor.\r\nWe started cooking yesterday starting with the turkey, homemade dressing, deviled eggs and potato salad.  Today we finished up everything and made two extra plates. You should have seen the smile and warm thanks that someone thought about them when we handed the plates to them. It makes your heart warm knowing they will have something to eat and have a feeling of not being alone.\r\nFinal menu:\r\nCajun butter infused turkey\r\nCornbread dressing \r\nPotato salad \r\nDeviled eggs\r\nBrussel sprouts\r\nCorn on the cob\r\nHomemade giblet gravey\r\nCroissants \r\nCranberry sauce \r\nChocolate pie.\r\n\r\nTake care of those around you when you can and happy Thanksgiving ", "author": "Intrigued5050", "created": 1795556178623, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Ucanifuthink2", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Feels good man", "last_comment_created": 1795583815329, "content": "<p>The wife and i decided this year because its the first time ive been home for Thanksgiving in four years, that we would do it up this year. We started early getting things here and there, living on a fixed income sux. We have two elderly people in our park and they live alone, one is on dialysis and the other lives alone but is the block mayor.\nWe started cooking yesterday starting with the turkey, homemade dressing, deviled eggs and potato salad.  Today we finished up everything and made two extra plates. You should have seen the smile and warm thanks that someone thought about them when we handed the plates to them. It makes your heart warm knowing they will have something to eat and have a feeling of not being alone.\nFinal menu:\nCajun butter infused turkey\nCornbread dressing\nPotato salad\nDeviled eggs\nBrussel sprouts\nCorn on the cob\nHomemade giblet gravey\nCroissants\nCranberry sauce\nChocolate pie.</p>\n<p>Take care of those around you when you can and happy Thanksgiving</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "c